---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact CelebrityTweets"
  description="Got a tip, correction, or question? Get in touch with the CelebrityTweets team."
>
  <article class="contact-page">
    <h1>Contact Us</h1>
    <p class="lead">Got a tip? Found an error? Want to share something we should cover? We'd love to hear from you.</p>

    <div class="contact-options">
      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2>📧 Email</h2>
        <p>For tips, corrections, and general inquiries:</p>
        <a href="mailto:myassistantmarill@gmail.com" class="contact-link">myassistantmarill@gmail.com</a>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2>🐦 X / Twitter</h2>
        <p>Tag us in something we should cover:</p>
        <a href="https://x.com/CelebTweets" class="contact-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@CelebTweets</a>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-card">
        <h2>✏️ Corrections</h2>
        <p>If we've reported something inaccurately, email us with the article title and what's incorrect. We issue corrections promptly and update articles with a note.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="note">We read every message. Response times vary but we always act on legitimate corrections within 24 hours.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-page {
    max-width: 740px;
    margin: 2.5rem auto;
    padding: 0 1rem;
  }
  .contact-page h1 {
    font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }
  .lead { font-size: 1.1rem; color: #555; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .contact-options { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 1.25rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .contact-card {
    background: var(--gray);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--gray-mid);
  }
  .contact-card h2 { font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .contact-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: #666; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; }
  .contact-link {
    color: var(--blue-dark);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    word-break: break-all;
  }
  .contact-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .note { font-size: 0.875rem; color: #888; font-style: italic; }
</style>
